This cockpit uses the official Lightweight Charts package for public HL
BTC-PERP candle rendering only. The browser never signs orders.

The in-chart attribution logo is disabled (`layout.attributionLogo: false`).
The library's license permits this only when the product still names
TradingView as the creator and links to https://www.tradingview.com/, so the
cockpit renders that notice in the application footer under "Attribution".
If that footer notice is ever removed, re-enable `attributionLogo`.

